      <text:p xml:id="id161" text:id="id161" text:style-name="P30"><text:span text:style-name="T16">옛 극장은 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16">보수 공사로 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16">문을 </text:span><text:span text:style-name="T16">닫았습니다</text:span><text:span text:style-name="T17">.</text:span></text:p>
